<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rss xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" version="2.0" xmlns:itunes="http://www.itunes.com/dtds/podcast-1.0.dtd" xmlns:googleplay="http://www.google.com/schemas/play-podcasts/1.0"><channel><title><![CDATA[Notes From the Beginning]]></title><description><![CDATA[Just me spending most of my time following my curiosity]]></description><link>https://notesfromzero.substack.com</link><image><url>https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!NE74!,w_256,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb9cb1aff-fbd7-4e40-9219-d73ebeb4aa81_1280x1280.png</url><title>Notes From the Beginning</title><link>https://notesfromzero.substack.com</link></image><generator>Substack</generator><lastBuildDate>Thu, 01 Jan 2026 23:35:11 GMT</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://notesfromzero.substack.com/feed" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><copyright><![CDATA[Weijian Zhang]]></copyright><language><![CDATA[en]]></language><webMaster><![CDATA[simpleaiexplained@substack.com]]></webMaster><itunes:owner><itunes:email><![CDATA[simpleaiexplained@substack.com]]></itunes:email><itunes:name><![CDATA[Weijian Zhang]]></itunes:name></itunes:owner><itunes:author><![CDATA[Weijian Zhang]]></itunes:author><googleplay:owner><![CDATA[simpleaiexplained@substack.com]]></googleplay:owner><googleplay:email><![CDATA[simpleaiexplained@substack.com]]></googleplay:email><googleplay:author><![CDATA[Weijian Zhang]]></googleplay:author><itunes:block><![CDATA[Yes]]></itunes:block><item><title><![CDATA[Simplifying the YouTube Summariser: Command-Line First, with Streaming Next]]></title><description><![CDATA[We need to simplify!]]></description><link>https://notesfromzero.substack.com/p/simplifying-the-youtube-summariser</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://notesfromzero.substack.com/p/simplifying-the-youtube-summariser</guid><dc:creator><![CDATA[Weijian Zhang]]></dc:creator><pubDate>Thu, 01 Jan 2026 22:19:46 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!h3CG!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3013ca8f-6fe7-408e-80cc-ee53911e0012_1392x788.png" length="0" type="image/jpeg"/><content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>We need to simplify! Right now the youtube summariser tool (https://github.com/weijianzhg/youtube-summariser) offering both a web UI and a command-line option which feels a bit cumbersome. If we just focus on the command line tooling and make it really easy to use, that&#8217;s probably more beneficial. </p><p>If it&#8217;s only a command-line tool, I can package it as a Python package and publish it on PyPI, so other people can easily use it. I think that would bring more value to the tooling overall.</p><p>That&#8217;s what I did. You can find it here: https://pypi.org/project/youtube-summariser/</p><div class="captioned-image-container"><figure><a class="image-link image2 is-viewable-img" target="_blank" href="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!h3CG!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3013ca8f-6fe7-408e-80cc-ee53911e0012_1392x788.png" data-component-name="Image2ToDOM"><div class="image2-inset"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!h3CG!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3013ca8f-6fe7-408e-80cc-ee53911e0012_1392x788.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!h3CG!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3013ca8f-6fe7-408e-80cc-ee53911e0012_1392x788.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!h3CG!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3013ca8f-6fe7-408e-80cc-ee53911e0012_1392x788.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!h3CG!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3013ca8f-6fe7-408e-80cc-ee53911e0012_1392x788.png 1456w" sizes="100vw"><img src="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!h3CG!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3013ca8f-6fe7-408e-80cc-ee53911e0012_1392x788.png" width="644" height="364.5632183908046" data-attrs="{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/3013ca8f-6fe7-408e-80cc-ee53911e0012_1392x788.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:788,&quot;width&quot;:1392,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:644,&quot;bytes&quot;:119702,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://notesfromzero.substack.com/i/183184537?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3013ca8f-6fe7-408e-80cc-ee53911e0012_1392x788.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}" class="sizing-normal" alt="" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!h3CG!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3013ca8f-6fe7-408e-80cc-ee53911e0012_1392x788.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!h3CG!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3013ca8f-6fe7-408e-80cc-ee53911e0012_1392x788.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!h3CG!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3013ca8f-6fe7-408e-80cc-ee53911e0012_1392x788.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!h3CG!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3013ca8f-6fe7-408e-80cc-ee53911e0012_1392x788.png 1456w" sizes="100vw" fetchpriority="high"></picture><div class="image-link-expand"><div class="pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset"><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image"><svg role="img" style="height:20px;width:20px" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="var(--color-fg-primary)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><g><title></title><path d="M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2"><polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"></polyline><polyline points="9 21 3 21 3 15"></polyline><line x1="21" x2="14" y1="3" y2="10"></line><line x1="3" x2="10" y1="21" y2="14"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>Another thing is streaming. For larger inputs, like a YouTube video that&#8217;s several hours long, users probably won&#8217;t want to wait for the entire output to finish. It&#8217;d be better to stream the results as they&#8217;re generated and keep the connection alive the whole time. I will do this next.</p>]]></content:encoded></item><item><title><![CDATA[Reviving a YouTube Summariser with CLI Support and Model Upgrades]]></title><description><![CDATA[I want to take a pretty simple idea from a project I did about nine months ago.]]></description><link>https://notesfromzero.substack.com/p/reviving-a-youtube-summariser-with</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://notesfromzero.substack.com/p/reviving-a-youtube-summariser-with</guid><dc:creator><![CDATA[Weijian Zhang]]></dc:creator><pubDate>Wed, 31 Dec 2025 23:00:45 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Qm_O!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9f99c911-3507-437e-98b4-75b3a47ee648_1378x912.png" length="0" type="image/jpeg"/><content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>I want to take a pretty simple idea from a project I did about nine months ago. It&#8217;s a YouTube summariser I built mostly through vibe coding, and I haven&#8217;t touched the codebase since &#8212; it&#8217;s just been sitting on GitHub at: https://github.com/weijianzhg/youtube-summariser (MIT Licensed)</p><div class="captioned-image-container"><figure><a class="image-link image2 is-viewable-img" target="_blank" href="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Qm_O!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9f99c911-3507-437e-98b4-75b3a47ee648_1378x912.png" data-component-name="Image2ToDOM"><div class="image2-inset"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Qm_O!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9f99c911-3507-437e-98b4-75b3a47ee648_1378x912.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Qm_O!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9f99c911-3507-437e-98b4-75b3a47ee648_1378x912.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Qm_O!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9f99c911-3507-437e-98b4-75b3a47ee648_1378x912.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Qm_O!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9f99c911-3507-437e-98b4-75b3a47ee648_1378x912.png 1456w" sizes="100vw"><img src="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Qm_O!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9f99c911-3507-437e-98b4-75b3a47ee648_1378x912.png" width="599" height="396.43541364296084" data-attrs="{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/9f99c911-3507-437e-98b4-75b3a47ee648_1378x912.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:912,&quot;width&quot;:1378,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:599,&quot;bytes&quot;:102013,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://weijianzhg.substack.com/i/183099436?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9f99c911-3507-437e-98b4-75b3a47ee648_1378x912.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}" class="sizing-normal" alt="" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Qm_O!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9f99c911-3507-437e-98b4-75b3a47ee648_1378x912.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Qm_O!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9f99c911-3507-437e-98b4-75b3a47ee648_1378x912.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Qm_O!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9f99c911-3507-437e-98b4-75b3a47ee648_1378x912.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Qm_O!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9f99c911-3507-437e-98b4-75b3a47ee648_1378x912.png 1456w" sizes="100vw" fetchpriority="high"></picture><div class="image-link-expand"><div class="pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset"><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image"><svg role="img" style="height:20px;width:20px" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="var(--color-fg-primary)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><g><title></title><path d="M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2"><polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"></polyline><polyline points="9 21 3 21 3 15"></polyline><line x1="21" x2="14" y1="3" y2="10"></line><line x1="3" x2="10" y1="21" y2="14"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class="image-caption">This is the web UI interface.</figcaption></figure></div><p>Now I&#8217;m realising it&#8217;d be cool to add a new feature: support for the command line (CLI), not just a web UI. Basically, I want to open a terminal, paste in a YouTube link, and have it summarise the content to the right length.</p><p>I also bumped up the token limit since the newer models can handle more tokens now, though that might change later. And lastly, I want to upgrade the models and do a comparison, specifically, test the latest OpenAI model against the newer Claude models, which is supposed to be really fast with solid performance.</p><div class="captioned-image-container"><figure><a class="image-link image2" target="_blank" href="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mi7-!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1eb9da6d-1347-47f0-82fe-36e5b66797d4_768x229.png" data-component-name="Image2ToDOM"><div class="image2-inset"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mi7-!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1eb9da6d-1347-47f0-82fe-36e5b66797d4_768x229.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mi7-!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1eb9da6d-1347-47f0-82fe-36e5b66797d4_768x229.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mi7-!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1eb9da6d-1347-47f0-82fe-36e5b66797d4_768x229.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mi7-!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1eb9da6d-1347-47f0-82fe-36e5b66797d4_768x229.png 1456w" sizes="100vw"><img src="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mi7-!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1eb9da6d-1347-47f0-82fe-36e5b66797d4_768x229.png" width="768" height="229" data-attrs="{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/1eb9da6d-1347-47f0-82fe-36e5b66797d4_768x229.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:229,&quot;width&quot;:768,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:33082,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://weijianzhg.substack.com/i/183099436?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1eb9da6d-1347-47f0-82fe-36e5b66797d4_768x229.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}" class="sizing-normal" alt="" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mi7-!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1eb9da6d-1347-47f0-82fe-36e5b66797d4_768x229.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mi7-!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1eb9da6d-1347-47f0-82fe-36e5b66797d4_768x229.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mi7-!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1eb9da6d-1347-47f0-82fe-36e5b66797d4_768x229.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mi7-!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1eb9da6d-1347-47f0-82fe-36e5b66797d4_768x229.png 1456w" sizes="100vw"></picture><div></div></div></a><figcaption class="image-caption">This is the CLI interface.</figcaption></figure></div><p>I&#8217;ve also added a really simple <code>config.yml</code> so users can specify the model name and the max tokens to use. It&#8217;s a simple tool, but honestly pretty helpful.</p><p>For me, the main use case is that there&#8217;s a lot of great educational content on YouTube, but many videos are like 30 minutes to an hour long, and I just don&#8217;t have time to sit through all of them. I like the idea of having those videos summarised in words instead.</p><p>As a next step, I&#8217;m thinking about building some kind of connections or visualisation layer on top of the summaries: something that helps show how different ideas relate to each other. I think that could be really useful, but I need to think more about how to approach it.</p><p></p>]]></content:encoded></item></channel></rss>